msgstr "規則"

#: manual/architecture.md:133
msgid "Owner"
msgstr "持ち主"

#: manual/architecture.md:135
msgid "Latest release, current dependencies, signals and time windows"
msgstr "最新リリース、現在の依存関係、シグナル、時間枠"

#: manual/architecture.md:135
msgid "`src/metrics` (called through `src/cli`)"
msgstr "`src/metrics`（`src/cli` 経由で呼び出し）"

#: manual/architecture.md:136
msgid "Score, grades, rank positions and momentum; the label lists"
msgstr "スコア、グレード、順位、勢い、ラベルのリスト"

#: manual/architecture.md:137
msgid "Query language, flat parameters, sort keys, paging"
msgstr "クエリ言語、フラットなパラメーター、並べ替えキー、ページング"

#: manual/architecture.md:138
