#~ msgid "The historical window is the recent window shifted 30 days back, so the two snapshots are computed the same way, with one exception: downloads have no history, so the whole download term counts as growth. A package whose release date is unknown gets the multiplier $0.88$ in both snapshots, so unchanged counts give zero growth."
